# ward_hallway.dlg
# A short exchange in the room itself - no close-up, no portraits. Good for
# anything under a dozen lines.

:: start
Ward: Choi. You're on tonight.
Choi: Every night.
Ward @amused: Somebody has to be.

+ [Ask about the file on your desk] -> ask_file
+ [Ask why he's still here] -> ask_late
+ [Say nothing] -> nothing

:: ask_file
Choi: There's a file on my desk that isn't mine.
Ward: There's a file on everyone's desk that isn't theirs.
Ward @flat: Read it or don't.
set trust_ward += 1
-> parting

:: ask_late
Choi: You've been signed in for nineteen hours.
Ward @tired: Have I.
> He doesn't check the log. He already knows.
set suspicion += 1
-> parting

:: nothing
> You let it sit. Ward waits exactly long enough to make the silence yours.
Ward: Right.
-> parting

:: parting
Ward: Desk's over there. Try the chair, it's new.
end
